{"4270640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Super Rocket Monkey", "steam_appid": 4270640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270640/extras/1b84cfd6fdd3b95d5e01fa68b4ea9b62.avif?t=1779550653\" width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ooo aa AAA ooo AAA!</strong> Embark on an epic adventure in this original Top Down Foddian experience in search of the ancient Golden Banana. Can YOU control this Rocket powered Monkey?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270640/extras/4d101aac7462bb2030f59e81545f4a2c.poster.avif?t=1779550653\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270640/extras/4d101aac7462bb2030f59e81545f4a2c.webm?t=1779550653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270640/extras/4d101aac7462bb2030f59e81545f4a2c.mp4?t=1779550653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jet pack Mechanics:</strong> Experience smooth, momentum-based jet pack flight that feels as rewarding as it is dangerous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Binocular Mechanics:</strong> Plan your flight by using binoculars to see what dangers may lay ahead!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tough but Addictive:</strong> A brutal gameplay loop designed for those who find satisfaction in overcoming challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Checkpoints:</strong> A unique system designe